  "decision_conditions": [
    "TREE WORKS (COMPLIANCE):  All tree work shall be carried out in accordance with British Standard BS3998 - Recommendations for Tree Work.  In addition: \r\na)   No fires shall be lit within [10] metres of the nearest point of the canopy of any retained tree.  No equipment, machinery or structure shall be attached to or supported by a retained tree.\r\nb)   No mixing of cement or use of other contaminating materials or substances shall take place within, or close enough to, a root protection area that seepage or displacement could cause them to enter a root protection area. \r\nc)   No alterations or variations to the approved works or tree protection schemes shall be made without prior written consent of the local planning authority.\r\n\r\nREASON:  In the interest of the protection of trees and to safeguard visual amenities."
